WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.269 --> 00:00:04.539
PACIFIC.

00:00:03.071 --> 00:00:05.807
NATIONAL SECURITY CORRESPONDENT

00:00:04.673 --> 00:00:07.843
JENNIFER GRIFFIN TELLS US ABOUT

00:00:05.941 --> 00:00:10.145
A REINFORCED MESSAGE TO CHINA.

00:00:07.976 --> 00:00:11.346
&gt;&gt; THE UNITED STATES MILITARY

00:00:10.278 --> 00:00:12.747
HAS HAD A LOT OF EXPERIENCE IN

00:00:11.480 --> 00:00:13.415
THE WESTERN PACIFIC TAKING ON

00:00:12.881 --> 00:00:15.984
SMALLER ISLANDS.

00:00:13.548 --> 00:00:17.886
&gt;&gt; A NOT SO VEILED WARNING TO

00:00:16.117 --> 00:00:20.522
CHINA TO BUILD UP SECURITY IN

00:00:18.019 --> 00:00:22.757
THE CHINA SEA.

00:00:20.655 --> 00:00:25.293
SHOWING CHINA HAS PLACED NEW

00:00:22.891 --> 00:00:27.028
SURFACE-TO-AIR MISSILES IN THE

00:00:25.427 --> 00:00:28.363
SPRATLY, AND RECENTLY LANDED

00:00:27.162 --> 00:00:28.663
NUCLEAR CAPABLE BOMBERS ON WOODY

00:00:28.497 --> 00:00:31.233
ALLEN.

00:00:28.797 --> 00:00:32.534
CHINA CALLS THE ACCUSATION

00:00:31.366 --> 00:00:33.435
RIDICULOUS.

00:00:32.667 --> 00:00:34.135
DEFENSE SECRETARY JIM MATTIS

00:00:33.568 --> 00:00:37.539
WILL REASSURE ALLIES THAT THE

00:00:34.269 --> 00:00:38.273
U.S. WILL NOT ALLOW CHINA TO

00:00:37.672 --> 00:00:42.444
SPREAD ITS INFLUENCE UNCHECKED.

00:00:38.406 --> 00:00:46.515
&gt;&gt; THERE HAD BEEN A PROMISE IN

00:00:42.577 --> 00:00:48.517
2015 BY PRESIDENT XI WHERE HE

00:00:46.648 --> 00:00:49.317
STATED THAT THEY WOULD NOT BE

00:00:48.650 --> 00:00:50.352
MILITARY RISING THE ISLANDS.

00:00:49.451 --> 00:00:52.287
WE HAVE SEEN THAT THEY HAVE DONE

00:00:50.485 --> 00:00:54.823
EXACTLY THAT.

00:00:52.420 --> 00:00:57.125
&gt;&gt; HAD A CHANGE OF COMMAND

00:00:54.956 --> 00:01:00.128
CEREMONY IN HAWAII, THE OUTGOING

00:00:57.259 --> 00:01:01.496
HEAD OF U.S. PACIFIC HORSES,

00:01:00.262 --> 00:01:02.063
ADMIRAL HARRY HARRIS, ISSUED

00:01:01.630 --> 00:01:05.333
ANOTHER WARNING.

00:01:02.197 --> 00:01:06.835
&gt;&gt; CHINA REMAINS THE BIGGEST

00:01:05.467 --> 00:01:09.137
LONG-TERM CHALLENGE, WITHOUT

00:01:06.968 --> 00:01:09.871
FOCUS, INVOLVEMENT, AND

00:01:09.271 --> 00:01:11.172
ENGAGEMENT BY THE UNITED STATES

00:01:10.005 --> 00:01:14.910
AND OUR ALLIES AND PARTNERS,

00:01:11.306 --> 00:01:15.510
THEY WILL REALIZE A GEMINI IN A

00:01:15.043 --> 00:01:16.411
JOB.

00:01:15.644 --> 00:01:18.947
WE SHOULD COOPERATE WITH BEIJING

00:01:16.545 --> 00:01:20.148
WHERE WE CAN, BUT STAND READY TO

00:01:19.080 --> 00:01:22.551
CONFRONT THEM WHEN WE MUST.

00:01:20.282 --> 00:01:24.519
&gt;&gt; THE U.S. HAS STEPPED UP

00:01:22.684 --> 00:01:26.154
OPERATIONS TO COUNTER CHINA,

00:01:24.653 --> 00:01:27.956
SENDING NAVAL VESSELS NEAR THE

00:01:26.288 --> 00:01:28.757
MAN-MADE ISLANDS THIS PAST

00:01:28.089 --> 00:01:29.791
WEEKEND.

00:01:28.890 --> 00:01:32.961
AND MATTIS ANNOUNCES HE HAS

00:01:29.925 --> 00:01:35.030
CHANGED THE NAME OF PAY COMMS TO

00:01:33.094 --> 00:01:37.132
END OPAQUE CALM, A SHOT ACROSS

00:01:35.163 --> 00:01:40.535
THE BOW AT CHINA THAT FEELS

00:01:37.265 --> 00:01:42.337
THREATENED BY WAY RIVAL INDIA.

00:01:40.669 --> 00:01:43.138
IT SERVES AS A BACKDROP TO

00:01:42.470 --> 00:01:45.407
POTENTIAL NORTH KOREA TALKS.

00:01:43.271 --> 00:01:49.778
&gt;&gt; THE 27 YEAR HOLIDAY FROM

00:01:45.540 --> 00:01:51.379
HISTORY IS OVER.

